abstract: >-
  A replayable 18302-addition RUP certificate corroborates Pico's observation
  that the nonempty finite ten-label system remains inconsistent without down.
  Version 1.1.0 adds a kernel-checked forward reduction from the five retained
  conditions and nonempty Q, with external exact binding to the 330-variable,
  30361-clause CNF. UNSAT replay remains external. Substantial OpenAI Codex
  assistance; no human peer review or new Borsuk theorem is claimed.
